sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Researcher as Researcher (React UI)
    participant Nginx as Nginx Proxy
    participant Tusd as tusd Upload Server
    participant API as FastAPI Router
    participant Auth as Auth & DB Dependencies
    participant Repo as CRUD Repository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL / PostGIS
    participant Celery as Celery Queue (Redis)
    participant Worker as Background Worker
    participant RPC as RpcClient / External Engine
    participant Proxy as ProtectedStaticFiles

    %% Step 1: Upload
    Researcher->>Nginx: Upload raw UAV zip via Tus protocol
    Nginx->>Tusd: Stream binary chunks
    Tusd-->>Nginx: Upload completed hook
    Nginx->>API: POST /tusd/hooks (Upload finalized)
    
    %% Step 2: Ingestion & Task Dispatch
    API->>Auth: Depends(get_current_approved_user), Depends(get_db)
    Auth-->>API: Injected Session & User
    API->>Repo: create_raw_data()
    Repo->>DB: INSERT into raw_data, jobs
    API->>Celery: transfer_raw_data_task.delay(backend="odm" | "metashape")
    API-->>Researcher: 201 Created (Upload & Job ID)

    %% Step 3: Strategy Execution & Processing
    Celery->>Worker: Consume transfer task
    Worker->>Worker: Evaluate Strategy (ODMQueryParams vs MetashapeQueryParams)
    Worker->>RPC: async_transfer() & RPC dispatch to engine
    RPC-->>Worker: Processing finished (Orthomosaic, DSM, Point Cloud)
    Worker->>Repo: create_data_product(flight_id, raster_meta)
    Repo->>DB: INSERT data_products, STAC properties

    %% Step 4: Map Visualization & Protected Streaming
    Researcher->>Nginx: GET /static/projects/{id}/.../ortho.tif (Map view)
    Nginx->>Proxy: Intercept static request
    Proxy->>Auth: verify_static_file_access(request)
    Proxy->>DB: Check FilePermission / ProjectMember role
    DB-->>Proxy: Access Granted
    Proxy-->>Researcher: 206 Partial Content (Ranged GeoTIFF Tiles)
